sequenceDiagram
  participant Shell
  participant Feed
  participant Worker

  Shell->>Feed: GET manifest.json
  Feed-->>Shell: {version, url, sha256, sig}
  Shell->>Shell: verify manifest signature (Ed25519)
  Shell->>Feed: GET artifact
  Feed-->>Shell: binary bytes
  Shell->>Shell: verify sha256 + artifact signature
  Shell->>Worker: pre-migration hook (export schema)
  Shell->>Worker: graceful stop (POST /shutdown, 5s)
  Shell->>Shell: atomic rename binaries
  Shell->>Shell: backup SQLite -> backups/pre-<version>
  Shell->>Shell: run migrations in order
  Shell->>Shell: restart shell -> spawn new worker
  Worker-->>Shell: /healthz 200
  Shell-->>Shell: emit I_SHELL_UPGRADED
  Note over Shell,Worker: On failure at any step:<br/>restore binaries + backup,<br/>emit E_SHELL_UPDATE_FAILED
